---
import Main from "../../layouts/Main.astro";
---

<Main
  title="SyncID Labs - Actualizing Canada's strategic futures"
  description="SyncID Labs builds the innovation district, the founder and research pipelines, and the coalitions of ventures that turn foresight into a sovereign, economically powerful Canada."
  lang="en"
  activePath="/"
>
  <!-- Hero (dark band) -->
  <section class="bg-ink text-white">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-28 sm:py-36 lg:px-10">
      <p class="eyebrow text-white/50">Synchronous Incubation and Development Labs</p>
      <h1
        class="font-display mt-8 max-w-5xl text-5xl font-medium leading-[1.03] tracking-[-0.03em] sm:text-6xl lg:text-[5.25rem]"
      >
        SyncID Labs actualizes Canada's strategic futures.
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-8 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/70 sm:text-xl">
        We build the innovation district, the founder and research pipelines, and the coalitions
        of ventures that turn foresight into a sovereign, economically powerful Canada.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-12 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-6">
        <a
          href="/en/contact"
          class="inline-flex items-center px-7 py-3.5 text-sm font-medium text-white transition-opacity hover:opacity-90"
          style="background-color: var(--wk-accent);"
        >
          Start a conversation
        </a>
        <a href="/en/district" class="text-sm font-medium text-white/80 hover:text-white">
          See the district &rarr;
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- The stakes (oversized editorial statement) -->
  <section class="border-b border-hairline">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-24 lg:px-10">
      <p class="eyebrow text-graphite/60">The stakes</p>
      <p
        class="font-display mt-6 max-w-4xl text-3xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl"
      >
        Canadian productivity has fallen to 71% of the US level.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-5 text-sm text-graphite">Bank of Canada, 2024</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- The district -->
  <section class="border-b border-hairline">
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-10 px-6 py-24 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:px-10">
      <div class="lg:col-span-3">
        <p class="eyebrow text-graphite/60">The district</p>
      </div>
      <div class="lg:col-span-9">
        <p class="max-w-3xl text-2xl leading-snug text-ink">
          A dense, mixed-use innovation district on 89 acres in Markham, built to keep Canadian
          talent, IP, and value at home.
        </p>
        <a href="/en/district" class="accent-link mt-6 inline-block text-sm font-medium">
          Explore the district
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Three doors -->
  <section class="border-b border-hairline">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-24 lg:px-10">
      <p class="eyebrow text-graphite/60">Three doors</p>
      <div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-1 gap-px bg-hairline md:grid-cols-3">
        <a href="/en/partners" class="group bg-canvas p-9 transition-colors hover:bg-neutral-50">
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-medium text-ink">Capital</h2>
          <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-graphite">
            A de-risked, methodology-backed coalition play toward defined Canadian futures.
          </p>
          <span class="accent-link mt-6 inline-block text-sm font-medium">For capital &rarr;</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/en/partners" class="group bg-canvas p-9 transition-colors hover:bg-neutral-50">
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-medium text-ink">Institutions</h2>
          <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-graphite">
            Bring your research and your alumni to a district built for actualizing Canada's futures.
          </p>
          <span class="accent-link mt-6 inline-block text-sm font-medium">For institutions &rarr;</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/en/partners" class="group bg-canvas p-9 transition-colors hover:bg-neutral-50">
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-medium text-ink">Founders</h2>
          <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-graphite">
            Place, peers, mission, and mentorship, alongside top researchers in Markham.
          </p>
          <span class="accent-link mt-6 inline-block text-sm font-medium">For founders &rarr;</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Credibility strip -->
  <section>
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-24 lg:px-10">
      <p class="max-w-4xl text-xl leading-relaxed text-graphite">
        Venture-studio pioneer since 2013. A proven Hybrid Intelligence&trade; methodology. A
        research-backed problem statement and a sized, multi-trillion-dollar opportunity.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Main>
